An offering of food to all created beings ({#BUtayajYa#}),
 one of the five daily Yajñas to be performed by a householder; <ab>cf.</ab> {#ahutaM#}
 {#ca hutaM cEva taTA prahutameva ca . brAhmapaM hutaM prASitaM ca paYcayajYAn#}
 {#pracakzate#} <ls>Ms. 3. 73</ls>; <ls>Bhāg. 7. 15. 49</ls>. It also means {#darSozwi#} ({#baliharaRa#});
 <ls>Bṛ. Up. 1. 5. 2</ls>.
